/	16-AUG-78	FIXED RELOC TO BE LIKE PAL8 AND DUMP LITERALS
/	17-AUG-78	RELOC GIVES ERROR IF RELOC N NOT MATCHED BY RELOC
/			ALLOWED RELOC>
	.INCLUDE MGLOB.MA
	.ASECT OVRU,LEVEL=2,OVERLAY=4
	FIELD 4
